    "about.projectInformation" : {"localizations":{"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"项目信息\n\nGitHub: github.com/lalalaladam/FileAssociationManager\n\n使用 Swift、SwiftUI、Launch Services 和 Uniform Type Identifiers 构建。\n\nDefaultOpen 是一款用于查看和管理文件关联的独立原生 macOS 工具。"}},"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Project Information\n\nGitHub: github.com/lalalaladam/FileAssociationManager\n\nBuilt with Swift, SwiftUI, Launch Services, and Uniform Type Identifiers.\n\nDefaultOpen is an independent native macOS utility for inspecting and managing file associations."}}}},
